      "text":"1 line in the Hermes v0.23.5 notes: the CLI and TUI now support OSC 7577. That means Hermes can come back in the same conversation after your terminal restarts.\n\nIn a terminal that gives the pane an OSC7577_TOKEN, Hermes reports the command that reopens your session, along the https://t.co/Q5mljIgRol"
